Description: A work in progress library that currently mainly just ports third party work to R.
    Future iterations are planned to integrate with the ready4 framework
    (https://ready4-dev.github.io/ready4/).  This software has been made available as part of
    the process of testing and documenting the library.  If you
    have any questions, please contact the authors
